codemirror.mjs is a `deno bundle --platform browser --format esm` of scripts/codemirror-entry.js
(which names the versions above with npm: specifiers), rebuilt by scripts/vendor-codemirror.sh:

  cd scripts && deno bundle --no-config --no-lock --platform browser --format esm \
    -o ../devc/web/static/vendor/codemirror/codemirror.mjs codemirror-entry.js
  sed -i 's#^// .*/registry\.npmjs\.org/#// npm:#' devc/web/static/vendor/codemirror/codemirror.mjs

The sed only shortens the per-module path comments (which otherwise name the local deno cache).
The entry file is not in this directory: `deno compile --include web/static` would follow its
npm: imports into the devc binary.
